  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "No chapter describes her appearance.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal Yi Yan, a rank eight wisdom path Gu Immortal and friend of Long Hair Ancestor, spends fifty years of his life to deduce that after three great eras three Venerables will appear, two men and one woman: Spectral Soul Demon Venerable, Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable, and Great Dream Immortal Venerable. That deduction becomes the Prophecy of Three Venerables. The same stretch says the problem of Space Escape Gu will be solved by Great Dream Immortal Venerable, that Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable is already dead, and that only Great Dream Immortal Venerable has yet to be born. Long Hair Ancestor’s land spirit at Lang Ya blessed land holds one obsession: to see Great Dream Immortal Venerable solve that Gu problem, after which the blessed land would belong to her.",
      "chapters": [
        461
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_immortal_yi_yan",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_long_hair_ancestor",
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable",
        "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable",
        "sys_prophecy_of_three_venerables",
        "gu_space_escape_gu",
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the Gu world, rank nine is Venerable. Immortal Venerable names a rank nine righteous Gu Master; Demon Venerable names a rank nine demonic path Gu Master.",
      "chapters": [
        383
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_righteous_path",
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The prophecy places her as an Immortal Venerable still ahead of Fang Yuan’s generation when he compares his recipes to Lang Ya’s accumulation.",
      "chapters": [
        461
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later Lang Ya note again ties the land spirit’s obsession to Space Escape Gu and Great Dream Immortal Venerable.",
      "chapters": [
        490
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lang-ya-obsession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "According to the prophecy, the five regions war starts the great era in which this generation’s Great Dream Immortal Venerable would be born.",
      "chapters": [
        668
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-theory",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A later recount of the prophecy again names her as the third Venerable and Space Escape Gu’s solver, and a common theory holds that the dream realm is the opportunity to become Great Dream Immortal Venerable.",
      "chapters": [
        734
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-theory",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "By then the prophecy has spread through the five regions, and because of her almost all super forces and rank eight powerhouses are researching dream path. From the prophecy’s two male Venerables and one female Venerable, Fang Yuan deduces that Great Dream Immortal Venerable would be a female Immortal Venerable.",
      "chapters": [
        763
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-theory",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He also notes that in his previous life he did not live until she appeared.",
      "chapters": [
        775
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-theory",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Duke Long tells Fairy Zi Wei that Heavenly Court needs its fourth Immortal Venerable, Great Dream Immortal Venerable, and that receiving and guiding her requires removing every obstacle: Fang Yuan, Giant Sun, and Red Lotus.",
      "chapters": [
        1384
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fourth-immortal-venerable",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_duke_long",
        "char_fairy_zi_wei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Duke Long of Heavenly Court names Feng Jin Huang the future Great Dream Immortal Venerable and takes her as a disciple toward a rank nine throne, saying a dream path Immortal Gu chose her when she was young, that fate Immortal Gu will be completely restored in ten years, and that her becoming Great Dream Immortal Venerable is predestined by fate. The chapter title itself is “Great Dream Immortal Venerable Feng Jin Huang”.",
      "chapters": [
        1440
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "named-disciple",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_feng_jin_huang",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the ceremony Duke Long sends everyone out but Feng Jin Huang and her parents, and tells the three of them that Feng Jin Huang is the prospective Great Dream Immortal Venerable and Feng Jiu Ge is her Dao Guardian, adding that this is a heavenly secret that should not have been revealed, but that it no longer matters because Shadow Sect has already learned of it.",
      "chapters": [
        1442
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "a-heavenly-secret-already-leaked",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "sys_dao_guardian",
        "fac_shadow_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Duke Long’s death and fate Gu’s destruction, Heavenly Court debate treats Feng Jin Huang’s former certainty as gone: she was Duke Long’s disciple and the future Great Dream Immortal Venerable, but that certainty no longer holds.",
      "chapters": [
        1970
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "after-fate-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_fate_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A late account again lists Immortal Yi Yan’s Prophecy of Three Venerables naming Spectral Soul, Paradise Earth, and Great Dream, and states that after Fang Yuan destroyed fate Gu the prophecy was no longer set in stone.",
      "chapters": [
        2085
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "prophecy-after-fate-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
